        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Matheson, Charles Ives\n- Organizations: American Academy of Arts and Letters\n- Awards: Charles Ives Living\n- Places: Des Moines, Iowa\n- Topics: American composition, modernist composition\n\nFacts:\n- Charles Ives was born on October 20, 1874, and was an American modernist composer.\n- Charles Ives died on May 19, 1954.\n- James Matheson was born in 1970 in Des Moines, Iowa, and is an American composer.\n- In December 2011, the American Academy of Arts and Letters awarded James Matheson the Charles Ives Living.\n- The Charles Ives Living awarded to James Matheson provided $100,000 for two years from 2012 to 2014.",
